</ul>
<hr data-start="506" data-end="509">
<h1 data-start="511" data-end="545" data-section-id="1y91i3k">What This Project Basically Does</h1>
<p data-start="547" data-end="573">Imagine a company uploads:</p>
<ul data-start="574" data-end="642">
<li data-start="574" data-end="587" data-section-id="g1r80k">
<p data-start="576" data-end="587">HR policies</p>
</li>
<li data-start="588" data-end="606" data-section-id="1xa8jhf">
<p data-start="590" data-end="606">Employee manuals</p>
</li>
<li data-start="607" data-end="626" data-section-id="1sjv4yp">
<p data-start="609" data-end="626">Project documents</p>
</li>
<li data-start="627" data-end="642" data-section-id="18lt7ou">
<p data-start="629" data-end="642">Internal PDFs</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="644" data-end="667">Then employees can ask:</p>
<blockquote data-start="669" data-end="777">
<p data-start="671" data-end="777">“What is the leave policy?”<br>
“How many vacation days are allowed?”<br>
“What is the reimbursement process?”</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="779" data-end="817">Instead of keyword search, the system:</p>
<ol data-start="818" data-end="964">
<li data-start="818" data-end="853" data-section-id="cbf75k">
<p data-start="821" data-end="853">Understands meaning semantically</p>
</li>
<li data-start="854" data-end="896" data-section-id="tn6zrk">
<p data-start="857" data-end="896">Searches relevant chunks from documents</p>
</li>
<li data-start="897" data-end="920" data-section-id="t7nr4u">
<p data-start="900" data-end="920">Sends context to LLM</p>
</li>
<li data-start="921" data-end="964" data-section-id="1bs0l7j">
<p data-start="924" data-end="964">Generates accurate answer with citations</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="966" data-end="978">That is RAG.</p>
<hr data-start="980" data-end="983">
<h1 data-start="985" data-end="1004" data-section-id="dis8o">Main Architecture</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1006" data-end="1242"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Documents (PDF/DOCX/TXT)</span><br><span>        ↓</span><br><span>Amazon S3 Bucket</span><br><span>        ↓</span><br><span>Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Base</span><br><span>        ↓</span><br><span>Vector Embeddings + Retrieval</span><br><span>        ↓</span><br><span>LLM (Claude / Titan)</span><br><span>        ↓</span><br><span>Streamlit Web App</span><br><span>        ↓</span><br><span>Employee asks questions</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
