request-WEB:5adc0765-78bd-4c49-aaa4-eb6d1e053a51-2" data-turn-id-container="request-WEB:5adc0765-78bd-4c49-aaa4-eb6d1e053a51-2" data-testid="conversation-turn-6" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="71c8264a-85c2-46de-8c75-755b23ba0745" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="83">Perfect 🚀<br data-start="10" data-end="13">
We’ll build this properly step-by-step like a real production project.</p>
<h1 data-start="85" data-end="124" data-section-id="1jtd4zb">Step 1 — Understand the Complete Flow</h1>
<p data-start="126" data-end="186">Before coding, you must clearly understand the architecture.</p>
<h1 data-start="188" data-end="210" data-section-id="1b2yhmm">What We Are Building</h1>
<p data-start="212" data-end="250">An employee uploads company documents.</p>
<p data-start="252" data-end="282">Then users ask questions like:</p>
<blockquote data-start="284" data-end="347">
<p data-start="286" data-end="347">“What is the leave policy?”<br>
“What are reimbursement rules?”</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="349" data-end="360">The system:</p>
<ol data-start="361" data-end="477">
<li data-start="361" data-end="397" data-section-id="1ks2o0m">
<p data-start="364" data-end="397">Searches relevant document chunks</p>
</li>
<li data-start="398" data-end="421" data-section-id="rsahi7">
<p data-start="401" data-end="421">Sends context to LLM</p>
</li>
<li data-start="422" data-end="450" data-section-id="18niq6w">
<p data-start="425" data-end="450">Generates grounded answer</p>
</li>
<li data-start="451" data-end="477" data-section-id="77fby">
<p data-start="454" data-end="477">Shows citations/sources</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="479" data-end="494">This is called:</p>
<h1 data-start="496" data-end="514" data-section-id="fqx2vb">RAG Architecture</h1>
<p data-start="516" data-end="544">RAG = Retrieval + Generation</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="546" data-end="697"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>User Question</span><br><span>      ↓</span><br><span>Knowledge Base Search</span><br><span>      ↓</span><br><span>Relevant Document Chunks</span><br><span>      ↓</span><br><span>LLM (Claude/Titan)</span><br><span>      ↓</span><br><span>Final AI Answer</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="699" data-end="702">
<h1 data-start="704" data-end="728" data-section-id="5y8pu6">Technologies We’ll Use</h1>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="730" data-end="1250" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="730" data-end="754"><tr data-start="730" data-end="754"><th data-start="730" data-end="740" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Purpose</th><th data-start="740" data-end="754" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Technology</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="765" data-end="1250"><tr data-start="765" data-end="798"><td data-start="765" data-end="776" data-col-size="sm">Frontend</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="776" data-end="798">Python + Streamlit</td></tr><tr data-start="799" data-end="863"><td data-start="799" data-end="807" data-col-size="sm">Cloud</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="807" data-end="863"><a data-start="809" data-end="861" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://aws.amazon.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">AWS<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></td></tr><tr data-start="864" data-end="978"><td data-start="864" data-end="870" data-col-size="sm">RAG</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="870" data-end="978"><a data-start="872" data-end="976" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://aws.amazon.com/bedrock/knowledge-bases/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></td></tr><tr data-start="979" data-end="1055"><td data-start="979" data-end="989" data-col-size="sm">Storage</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="989" data-end="1055"><a data-start="991" data-end="1053" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://aws.amazon.com/s3/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Amazon S3<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></td></tr><tr data-start="1056" data-end="1137"><td data-start="1056" data-end="1069" data-col-size="sm">Deployment</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1069" data-end="1137"><a data-start="1071" data-end="1135" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://aws.amazon.com/ec2/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Amazon EC2<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></td></tr><tr data-start="1138" data-end="1250"><td data-start="1138" data-end="1148" data-col-size="sm">AWS SDK</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="1148" data-end="1250"><a data-start="1150" data-end="1248" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://boto3.amazonaws.com/v1/documentation/api/latest/index.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Boto3<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/