<hr data-start="1252" data-end="1255">
<h1 data-start="1257" data-end="1300" data-section-id="ibspa3">Step 2 — What You Need Before Development</h1>
<p data-start="1302" data-end="1311">You need:</p>
<h2 data-start="1313" data-end="1333" data-section-id="1z2zi">Required Accounts</h2>
<h3 data-start="1335" data-end="1353" data-section-id="62rcv1">1. AWS Account</h3>
<p data-start="1354" data-end="1366">Create here:</p>
<p data-start="1368" data-end="1433"><a data-start="1368" data-end="1433" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://aws.amazon.com/free/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">AWS Signup<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
<hr data-start="1435" data-end="1438">
<h1 data-start="1440" data-end="1459" data-section-id="1fsbcyf">VERY IMPORTANT ⚠️</h1>
<p data-start="1461" data-end="1478">For this project:</p>
<ul data-start="1479" data-end="1559">
<li data-start="1479" data-end="1507" data-section-id="1gy2iax">
<p data-start="1481" data-end="1507">Bedrock access is required</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1508" data-end="1533" data-section-id="1lednvi">
<p data-start="1510" data-end="1533">Billing must be enabled</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1534" data-end="1559" data-section-id="1fq6g6i">
<p data-start="1536" data-end="1559">Use free tier carefully</p>
</li>
