This happens a lot with AWS IAM users.</p>
<p data-start="56" data-end="86">You have 2 possibilities here:</p>
<h1 data-start="88" data-end="129" data-section-id="yr7cmj">Option 1 — Try Remembering IAM Username</h1>
<p data-start="131" data-end="184">The IAM username is the one you created earlier like:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="186" data-end="229"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>enterprise-rag-user</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="231" data-end="252">or something similar.</p>
<p data-start="254" data-end="285">If you remember it, just enter:</p>
<ul data-start="286" data-end="311">
<li data-start="286" data-end="300" data-section-id="1c52awr">
<p data-start="288" data-end="300">IAM username</p>
</li>
<li data-start="301" data-end="311" data-section-id="1nl9mev">
<p data-start="303" data-end="311">password</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="313" data-end="325">and sign in.</p>
<hr data-start="327" data-end="330">
<h1 data-start="332" data-end="375" data-section-id="1bo0s1r">Option 2 — Use Root User Instead (Easier)</h1>
<p data-start="377" data-end="476">Since this is your own AWS account and we are still setting up the project, the easiest way now is:</p>
<p data-start="478" data-end="484">Click:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="486" data-end="539"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Sign in using root user email</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="541" data-end="558">Then login using:</p>
<ul data-start="559" data-end="597">
<li data-start="559" data-end="586" data-section-id="1tfiwgo">
<p data-start="561" data-end="586">your AWS registered email</p>
</li>
<li data-start="587" data-end="597" data-section-id="1nl9mev">
<p data-start="589" data-end="597">password</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="599" data-end="621">If password forgotten:</p>
<ul data-start="622" data-end="673">
<li data-start="622" data-end="647" data-section-id="1wrj3z3">
<p data-start="624" data-end="647">click “Forgot password”</p>
</li>
<li data-start="648" data-end="673" data-section-id="zlotup">
<p data-start="650" data-end="673">reset through email OTP</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="675" data-end="678">
<h1 data-start="680" data-end="693" data-section-id="jnp57l">After Login</h1>
<p data-start="695" data-end="719">Once inside AWS console:</p>
<ol data-start="720" data-end="802">
<li data-start="720" data-end="732" data-section-id="1vyv8do">
<p data-start="723" data-end="732">Go to IAM</p>
</li>
<li data-start="733" data-end="763" data-section-id="5ldg1g">
<p data-start="736" data-end="763">Create a NEW IAM user again</p>
</li>
<li data-start="764" data-end="802" data-section-id="1xd5bsd">
<p data-start="767" data-end="802">Save credentials properly this time</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="804" data-end="816">Recommended:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="817" data-end="860"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>enterprise-rag-user</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="862" data-end="865">
<h1 data-start="867" data-end="886" data-section-id="1fsbcyf">VERY IMPORTANT ⚠️</h1>
<p data-start="888" data-end="916">This time save these safely:</p>
<ul data-start="917" data-end="968">
<li data-start="917" data-end="931" data-section-id="1c52awr">
<p data-start="919" data-end="931">IAM username</p>
</li>
<li data-start="932" data-end="942" data-section-id="1nl9mev">
<p data-start="934" data-end="942">password</p>
</li>
<li data-start="943" data-end="955" data-section-id="45ca7v">
<p data-start="945" data-end="955">access key</p>
</li>
<li data-start="956" data-end="968" data-section-id="ceyzjd">
<p data-start="958" data-end="968">secret key</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="970" data-end="986">You can save in:</p>
<ul data-start="987" data-end="1037">
<li data-start="987" data-end="996" data-section-id="fv36dp">
<p data-start="989" data-end="996">Notepad</p>
</li>
<li data-start="997" data-end="1015" data-section-id="eb2qh0">
<p data-start="999" data-end="1015">password manager</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1016" data-end="1037" data-section-id="1fnhxxc">
<p data-start="1018" data-end="1037"><code data-start="1018" data-end="1024">.txt</code> file locally</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1039" data-end="1069">But NEVER share them publicly.</p>
<hr data-start="1071" data-end="1074">
<h1 data-start="1076" data-end="1107" data-section-id="1qsmz">Best Practice For Our Project</h1>
<p data-start="1109" data-end="1128">Later we’ll create:</p>
<ul data-start="1129" data-end="1202">
<li data-start="1129" data-end="1154" data-section-id="1juw89c">
<p data-start="1131" data-end="1154">Access keys for AWS CLI</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1155" data-end="1177" data-section-id="hjhgrv">
<p data-start="1157" data-end="1177"><code data-start="1157" data-end="1163">.env</code> configuration</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1178" data-end="1202" data-section-id="bwugf2">
<p data-start="1180" data-end="1202">Bedrock authentication</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1204" data-end="1247" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">So keeping credentials safe is important 🔥</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Bad re