ose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="32">Now we found the actual issue 👍</p>
<p data-start="34" data-end="80">Your AWS account itself is closed/deactivated.</p>
<p data-start="82" data-end="99">The message says:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="101" data-end="147"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Your account is closed</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="149" data-end="160">That means:</p>
<ul data-start="161" data-end="244">
<li data-start="161" data-end="199" data-section-id="6q7qqw">
<p data-start="163" data-end="199">AWS account was previously closed<br>
OR</p>
</li>
<li data-start="200" data-end="244" data-section-id="1e6r57x">
<p data-start="202" data-end="244">AWS automatically suspended/deactivated it</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="246" data-end="262">Because of this:</p>
<ul data-start="263" data-end="341">
<li data-start="263" data-end="287" data-section-id="1hibwxz">
<p data-start="265" data-end="287">You cannot use Bedrock</p>
</li>
<li data-start="288" data-end="317" data-section-id="1p79769">
<p data-start="290" data-end="317">You cannot create IAM users</p>
</li>
<li data-start="318" data-end="341" data-section-id="kylove">
<p data-start="320" data-end="341">You cannot use S3/EC2</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="343" data-end="346">
<h1 data-start="348" data-end="379" data-section-id="7s6vgu">Best Solution (Recommended) ✅</h1>
<p data-start="381" data-end="406">Create a NEW AWS account.</p>
<p data-start="408" data-end="412">Use:</p>
<ul data-start="413" data-end="479">
<li data-start="413" data-end="439" data-section-id="vv4whn">
<p data-start="415" data-end="439">another Gmail account<br>
OR</p>
</li>
<li data-start="440" data-end="479" data-section-id="1tmyezj">
<p data-start="442" data-end="479">same Gmail if AWS allows reactivation</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="481" data-end="484">
<h1 data-start="486" data-end="508" data-section-id="1mmh8x1">Recommended Approach</h1>
<h2 data-start="510" data-end="551" data-section-id="1ysissf">Option 1 — Reactivate Existing Account</h2>
<p data-start="553" data-end="593">Sometimes AWS gives reactivation option.</p>
<p data-start="595" data-end="607">Try opening:</p>
<p data-start="609" data-end="715"><a data-start="609" data-end="715" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer">AWS Support Center<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
<p data-start="717" data-end="725">Request:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="726" data-end="775"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Reactivate my AWS account</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="777" data-end="800">But this can take time.</p>
<hr data-start="802" data-end="805">
<h1 data-start="807" data-end="825" data-section-id="1stuhn3">Faster Option 🚀</h1>
<h2 data-start="827" data-end="865" data-section-id="6ghgp6">Option 2 — Create Fresh AWS Account</h2>
<p data-start="867" data-end="875">Go here:</p>
<p data-start="877" data-end="950"><a data-start="877" data-end="950" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://aws.amazon.com/free/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Create AWS Account<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
<p data-start="952" data-end="956">Use:</p>
<ul data-start="957" data-end="1003">
<li data-start="957" data-end="968" data-section-id="tpouy">
<p data-start="959" data-end="968">new Gmail</p>
</li>
<li data-start="969" data-end="983" data-section-id="1dbh8xj">
<p data-start="971" data-end="983">phone number</p>
</li>
<li data-start="984" data-end="1003" data-section-id="8awe0w">
<p data-start="986" data-end="1003">debit/credit card</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1005" data-end="1010">Then:</p>
<ul data-start="1011" data-end="1049">
<li data-start="1011" data-end="1024" data-section-id="1uf18m9">
<p data-start="1013" data-end="1024">login fresh</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1025" data-end="1049" data-section-id="16kr5h7">
<p data-start="1027" data-end="1049">continue project setup</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1051" data-end="1054">
<h1 data-start="1056" data-end="1075" data-section-id="157269r">Important Note ⚠️</h1>
<p data-start="1077" data-end="1090">AWS requires:</p>
<ul data-start="1091" data-end="1126">
<li data-start="1091" data-end="1110" data-section-id="14loyjp">
<p data-start="1093" data-end="1110">card verification</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1111" data-end="1126" data-section-id="mkyv1g">
<p data-start="1113" data-end="1126">billing setup</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1128" data-end="1147">Even for free tier.</p>
<p data-start="1149" data-end="1177">For this project especially:</p>
<ul data-start="1178" data-end="1236">
<li data-start="1178" data-end="1205" data-section-id="1cmkz3">
<p data-start="1180" data-end="1205">Bedrock is NOT fully free</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1206" data-end="1236" data-section-id="1rhn0fc">
<p data-start="1208" data-end="1236">Some tiny charges may happen</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1238" data-end="1267">So monitor billing carefully.</p>
<hr data-start="1269" data-end="1272">
<h1 data-start="1274" data-end="1293" data-section-id="o0zp4r">My Recommendation</h1>
<p data-start="1295" data-end="1327">For learning + project building:</p>
<p data-start="1329" data-end="1423">✅ Create a fresh AWS account now<br data-start="1361" data-end="1364">
✅ Keep billing alerts enabled<br data-start="1393" data-end="1396">
✅ Continue project smoothly</p>
<p data-start="1425" data-end="1456" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">That will save a lot of time 👍</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Bad response" aria