<p data-start="447" data-end="458">Then click:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="460" data-end="492"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Continue</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="494" data-end="497">
<h1 data-start="499" data-end="524" data-section-id="cn5jm1">Important Next Steps ⚠️</h1>
<p data-start="526" data-end="542">AWS may ask for:</p>
<ul data-start="543" data-end="622">
<li data-start="543" data-end="577" data-section-id="13dmjfn">
<p data-start="545" data-end="577">PAN card / identity verification</p>
</li>
<li data-start="578" data-end="589" data-section-id="1cymhpb">
<p data-start="580" data-end="589">Phone OTP</p>
</li>
<li data-start="590" data-end="622" data-section-id="hx13nd">
<p data-start="592" data-end="622">Debit/Credit card verification</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="624" data-end="639">This is normal.</p>
<p data-start="641" data-end="663">Sometimes AWS charges:</p>
<ul data-start="664" data-end="706">
<li data-start="664" data-end="668" data-section-id="yhgvlv">
<p data-start="666" data-end="668">₹2</p>
</li>
<li data-start="669" data-end="674" data-section-id="1io3e8">
<p data-start="671" data-end="674">₹10</p>
</li>
<li data-start="675" data-end="706" data-section-id="wa8jqo">
<p data-start="677" data-end="706">temporary verification charge</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="708" data-end="739">Usually refunded automatically.</p>
<hr data-start="741" data-end="744">
<h1 data-start="746" data-end="785" data-section-id="hcwp3o">VERY IMPORTANT AFTER ACCOUNT CREATION</h1>
<p data-start="787" data-end="811">Once account is created:</p>
<ol data-start="812" data-end="915">
<li data-start="812" data-end="835" data-section-id="13fj9zk">
<p data-start="815" data-end="835">Login to AWS console</p>
</li>
<li data-start="836" data-end="861" data-section-id="14zc3gg">
<p data-start="839" data-end="861">Enable MFA if possible</p>
</li>
<li data-start="862" data-end="885" data-section-id="1lj93bt">
<p data-start="865" data-end="885">Create billing alert</p>
</li>
<li data-start="886" data-end="915" data-section-id="1g2t927">
<p data-start="889" data-end="915">Never share keys/passwords</p>
</li>
</ol>
