<p data-start="786" data-end="805">few minutes waiting</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="807" data-end="810">
<h1 data-start="812" data-end="826" data-section-id="1b4gpnz">IMPORTANT ⚠️</h1>
<p data-start="828" data-end="850">If Bedrock page shows:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="851" data-end="888"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Access denied</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="890" data-end="911">or model unavailable:</p>
<ul data-start="912" data-end="973">
<li data-start="912" data-end="926" data-section-id="vk8qee">
<p data-start="914" data-end="926">refresh page</p>
</li>
<li data-start="927" data-end="943" data-section-id="122pexp">
<p data-start="929" data-end="943">wait 5–10 mins</p>
</li>
<li data-start="944" data-end="973" data-section-id="1k8trce">
<p data-start="946" data-end="973">verify region = <code data-start="962" data-end="973">us-east-1</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
