class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="54">Excellent 🔥<br data-start="12" data-end="15">
Your S3 bucket is successfully created.</p>
<p data-start="56" data-end="117">Now we’ll upload enterprise documents for the Knowledge Base.</p>
<h1 data-start="119" data-end="153" data-section-id="ecjgj3">Step 1 — Create Sample Documents</h1>
<p data-start="155" data-end="192">On your laptop create 2–3 text files.</p>
<p data-start="194" data-end="203">Examples:</p>
<h2 data-start="205" data-end="226" data-section-id="1ttmbp3"><span role="text"><code data-start="208" data-end="226">leave_policy.txt</code></span></h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="228" data-end="400"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Employees are entitled to 20 paid leave days annually.</span><br><br><span>Unused leaves can be carried forward for one year.</span><br><br><span>Medical leave requires manager approval.</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="402" data-end="405">
<h2 data-start="407" data-end="436" data-section-id="1ezbtz2"><span role="text"><code data-start="410" data-end="436">reimbursement_policy.txt</code></span></h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="438" data-end="599"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Employees can claim travel reimbursements within 30 days.</span><br><br><span>All receipts must be attached.</span><br><br><span>Maximum hotel reimbursement is $150 per night.</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="601" data-end="604">
<h2 data-start="606" data-end="633" data-section-id="8452eu"><span role="text"><code data-start="609" data-end="633">remote_work_policy.txt</code></span></h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="635" data-end="805"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Employees may work remotely three days per week.</span><br><br><span>VPN usage is mandatory for remote access.</span><br><br><span>Confidential company data must not be stored locally.</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="807" data-end="810">
<h1 data-start="812" data-end="841" data-section-id="1cpr60v">Step 2 — Upload Files to S3</h1>
<p data-start="843" data-end="862">Inside your bucket:</p>
<p data-start="864" data-end="870">Click:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="872" data-end="902"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Upload</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="904" data-end="928">Select all <code data-start="915" data-end="921">.txt</code> files.</p>
<p data-start="930" data-end="935">Then:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="936" data-end="966"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Upload</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="968" data-end="971">
<h1 data-start="973" data-end="1001" data-section-id="1a01m6g">Why These Documents Matter</h1>
<p data-start="1003" data-end="1016">These become:</p>
<ul data-start="1017" data-end="1099">
<li data-start="1017" data-end="1046" data-section-id="pfdjw2">
<p data-start="1019" data-end="1046">enterprise knowledge source</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1047" data-end="1073" data-section-id="hvk3yu">
<p data-start="1049" data-end="1073">searchable semantic data</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1074" data-end="1099" data-section-id="12lasfi">
<p data-start="1076" data-end="1099">RAG context for Bedrock</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1101" data-end="1122">Later users will ask:</p>
<blockquote data-start="1124" data-end="1160">
<p data-start="1126" data-end="1160">“How many leave days are allowed?”</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="1162" data-end="1180">Bedrock retrieves:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1181" data-end="1232"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>20 paid leave days annually</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1234" data-end="1265">Then generates grounded answer.</p>
<hr data-start="1267" data-end="1270">
<h1 data-start="1272" data-end="1290" data-section-id="1ld6zmq">Next Big Step 🚀</h1>
<p data-start="1292" data-end="1320">After upload we will create:</p>
<h1 data-start="1322" data-end="1353" data-section-id="xhekwx">Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Base</h1>
<p data-start="1355" data-end="1383">This is the core RAG system:</p>
<ul data-start="1384" data-end="1453">
<li data-start="1384" data-end="1403" data-section-id="1mffcnw">
<p data-start="1386" data-end="1403">document chunking</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1404" data-end="1416" data-section-id="koaro4">
<p data-start="1406" data-end="1416">embeddings</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1417" data-end="1435" data-section-id="4t8il3">
<p data-start="1419" data-end="1435">vector retrieval</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1436" data-end="1453" data-section-id="1sirimk">
<p data-start="1438" data-end="1453">semantic search</p>
</li>
