<hr data-start="1055" data-end="1058">
<h1 data-start="1060" data-end="1094" data-section-id="l8k59">Why AWS Blocks Root User Here ⚠️</h1>
<p data-start="1096" data-end="1115">Bedrock KB creates:</p>
<ul data-start="1116" data-end="1186">
