iv class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="35">You’re inside the MFA setup page 👍</p>
<p data-start="37" data-end="74">To continue quickly with the project:</p>
<h1 data-start="76" data-end="89" data-section-id="mtsfol">Best Option</h1>
<p data-start="91" data-end="98">Choose:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="100" data-end="141"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Authenticator app</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="143" data-end="172">This is easier than passkeys.</p>
<hr data-start="174" data-end="177">
<h1 data-start="179" data-end="185" data-section-id="1htodv5">Then</h1>
<ol data-start="187" data-end="632">
<li data-start="187" data-end="485" data-section-id="1mkgnpf">
<p data-start="190" data-end="220">Install one app on your phone:</p>
<ul data-start="224" data-end="485">
<li data-start="224" data-end="357" data-section-id="ogxg4g">
<p data-start="226" data-end="357"><a data-start="226" data-end="357" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.google.android.apps.authenticator2&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com">Google Authenticator<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
</li>
<li data-start="361" data-end="485" data-section-id="zk3puz">
<p data-start="363" data-end="485">OR <a data-start="366" data-end="485" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.azure.authenticator&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com">Microsoft Authenticator<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="487" data-end="533" data-section-id="po5pf8">
<p data-start="490" data-end="504">AWS will show:</p>
<ul data-start="508" data-end="533">
<li data-start="508" data-end="517" data-section-id="5zls2u">
<p data-start="510" data-end="517">QR code</p>
</li>
<li data-start="521" data-end="533" data-section-id="ceyzjd">
<p data-start="523" data-end="533">secret key</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="535" data-end="573" data-section-id="1fa5zen">
<p data-start="538" data-end="573">Scan QR code with authenticator app</p>
</li>
<li data-start="575" data-end="609" data-section-id="rzgnl2">
<p data-start="578" data-end="609">Enter the 2 generated OTP codes</p>
</li>
<li data-start="611" data-end="632" data-section-id="1toqdcq">
<p data-start="614" data-end="632">Complete MFA setup</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="634" data-end="637">
<h1 data-start="639" data-end="659" data-section-id="oss5cd">Why MFA Matters ⚠️</h1>
<p data-start="661" data-end="718">AWS root account security is extremely important because:</p>
<ul data-start="719" data-end="775">
<li data-start="719" data-end="735" data-section-id="nb8hqf">
<p data-start="721" data-end="735">billing access</p>
</li>
<li data-start="736" data-end="752" data-section-id="vbd326">
<p data-start="738" data-end="752">IAM management</p>
</li>
<li data-start="753" data-end="775" data-section-id="bl9yt9">
<p data-start="755" data-end="775">full account control</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="777" data-end="818">MFA protects against unauthorized access.</p>
<hr data-start="820" data-end="823">
<h1 data-start="825" data-end="842" data-section-id="x2lemn">After MFA Setup</h1>
<p data-start="844" data-end="865">Immediately continue:</p>
