<h1 data-start="187" data-end="203" data-section-id="4zfw7f">Fastest Fix 🔥</h1>
<p data-start="205" data-end="276">Since you are already logged in as root, reset IAM user password again.</p>
<p data-start="278" data-end="286">Go here:</p>
