<h1 data-start="216" data-end="246" data-section-id="1kv33xv">URL Shortener Application 🔗</h1>
<p data-start="248" data-end="314">This is actually a very good portfolio project because it teaches:</p>
<ul data-start="315" data-end="437">
<li data-start="315" data-end="330" data-section-id="mgdfaf">
<p data-start="317" data-end="330">Flask routing</p>
</li>
<li data-start="331" data-end="353" data-section-id="536lmb">
<p data-start="333" data-end="353">Database integration</p>
</li>
<li data-start="354" data-end="361" data-section-id="170jq5p">
<p data-start="356" data-end="361">Forms</p>
</li>
<li data-start="362" data-end="381" data-section-id="ryr7vh">
<p data-start="364" data-end="381">Redirect handling</p>
</li>
<li data-start="382" data-end="399" data-section-id="1jid0jy">
<p data-start="384" data-end="399">CRUD operations</p>
</li>
<li data-start="400" data-end="421" data-section-id="63dbcy">
<p data-start="402" data-end="421">Deployment concepts</p>
</li>
<li data-start="422" data-end="437" data-section-id="12fu4bm">
<p data-start="424" data-end="437">Backend logic</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="439" data-end="479">And it looks professional on a resume 💼</p>
<hr data-start="481" data-end="484">
<h1 data-start="486" data-end="506" data-section-id="cwkkwm">What We Will Build</h1>
<p data-start="508" data-end="517">Features:</p>
<p data-start="519" data-end="701">✅ Long URL input<br data-start="535" data-end="538">
✅ Generate short URL<br data-start="558" data-end="561">
✅ Redirect short URL → original URL<br data-start="596" data-end="599">
✅ Store links in database<br data-start="624" data-end="627">
✅ Copy short URL<br data-start="643" data-end="646">
✅ Track clicks (optional advanced feature)<br data-start="688" data-end="691">
✅ Clean UI</p>
<hr data-start="703" data-end="706">
<h1 data-start="708" data-end="722" data-section-id="tb2u3q">Technologies</h1>
<p data-start="724" data-end="734">We’ll use:</p>
<ul data-start="736" data-end="784">
<li data-start="736" data-end="744" data-section-id="2q6buk">
<p data-start="738" data-end="744">Python</p>
</li>
<li data-start="745" data-end="752" data-section-id="170omor">
<p data-start="747" data-end="752">Flask</p>
