Now your next step is only <strong data-start="35" data-end="49">submission</strong> 🎉</p>
<h2 data-section-id="6iz140" data-start="54" data-end="71">What to submit</h2>
<p data-start="73" data-end="100">Usually institutes ask for:</p>
<ul data-start="102" data-end="205">
<li data-section-id="m0z8f2" data-start="102" data-end="132">
<p data-start="104" data-end="132">📂 Project folder / ZIP file</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pqu7xu" data-start="133" data-end="149">
<p data-start="135" data-end="149">📸 Screenshots</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18k2p2g" data-start="150" data-end="177">
<p data-start="152" data-end="177">🔗 GitHub link (optional)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1kvlx4g" data-start="178" data-end="205">
<p data-start="180" data-end="205">🎥 Demo video (sometimes)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="207" data-end="210">
<h2 data-section-id="cg3co5" data-start="212" data-end="233">Best way to submit</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="1kmpvef" data-start="235" data-end="259">1. Stop Flask server</h3>
<p data-start="261" data-end="273">In terminal:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="275" data-end="307"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>CTRL + C</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="309" data-end="312">
<h3 data-section-id="29j273" data-start="314" data-end="341">2. Check project folder</h3>
<p data-start="343" data-end="370">Your folder should contain:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="372" data-end="475"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-45720d6d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>url-shortener/</span><br><span>│</span><br><span>├── app.py</span><br><span>├── database.db</span><br><span>│</span><br><span>├── templates/</span><br><span>│   └── index.html</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="477" data-end="480">
<h3 data-section-id="1vkpnp6" data-start="482" data-end="504">3. Create ZIP file</h3>
<ul data-start="506" data-end="579">
<li data-section-id="1w8vrpq" data-start="506" data-end="535">
<p data-start="508" data-end="535">Right click <code data-start="520" data-end="535">url-shortener</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3unesh" data-start="536" data-end="579">
<p data-start="538" data-end="579">Click <strong data-start="544" data-end="579">Send to → Compressed ZIP folder</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="581" data-end="584">
<h3 data-section-id="h4amk" data-start="586" data-end="610">4. Upload assignment</h3>
<ul data-start="612" data-end="693">
<li data-section-id="1slu0n4" data-start="612" data-end="636">
<p data-start="614" data-end="636">Open internship portal</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1jz0c0o" data-start="637" data-end="664">
<p data-start="639" data-end="664">Click <strong data-start="645" data-end="664">View Assignment</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mh03ou" data-start="665" data-end="682">
<p data-start="667" data-end="682">Upload ZIP file</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="10cp86x" data-start="683" data-end="693">
<p data-start="685" data-end="693">Submit ✅</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="695" data-end="698">
<h2 data-section-id="gtmvaw" data-start="700" data-end="730">Optional but recommended 📸</h2>
<p data-start="732" data-end="751">Take 2 screenshots:</p>
<ol data-start="753" data-end="805">
<li data-section-id="inopd3" data-start="753" data-end="771">
<p data-start="756" data-end="771">VS Code project</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1777jf3" data-start="772" data-end="805">
<p data-start="775" data-end="805">Running application in browser</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="807" data-end="875">You already have a professional UI, so screenshots will look good 👍</p>
