<p data-start="187" data-end="236">That is enough for most internship submissions 🎉</p>
<h2 data-section-id="1s1cwjn" data-start="238" data-end="260">About demo video 🎥</h2>
<p data-start="262" data-end="288">Take a demo video only if:</p>
<ul data-start="290" data-end="366">
<li data-section-id="17n3uhv" data-start="290" data-end="330">
<p data-start="292" data-end="330">assignment specifically asks for video</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16sr4lk" data-start="331" data-end="366">
<p data-start="333" data-end="366">or you want stronger presentation</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="368" data-end="421">Otherwise screenshots + ZIP file are completely fine.</p>
<hr data-start="423" data-end="426">
<h2 data-section-id="10xazr" data-start="428" data-end="475">If you want a quick demo video (recommended)</h2>
<p data-start="477" data-end="503">Just record 30–60 seconds:</p>
<ol data-start="505" data-end="658">
<li data-section-id="1liojra" data-start="505" data-end="520">
<p data-start="508" data-end="520">Open VS Code</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="r6ols2" data-start="521" data-end="543">
<p data-start="524" data-end="543">Run <code data-start="528" data-end="543">python app.py</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1v0lov4" data-start="544" data-end="559">
<p data-start="547" data-end="559">Open browser</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bjqr5a" data-start="560" data-end="579">
<p data-start="563" data-end="579">Paste Google URL</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="otjfer" data-start="580" data-end="602">
<p data-start="583" data-end="602">Click “Shorten URL”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1cwbrns" data-start="603" data-end="630">
<p data-start="606" data-end="630">Show generated short URL</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="v8wbld" data-start="631" data-end="658">
<p data-start="634" data-end="658">Click short URL redirect</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="660" data-end="666">Done ✅</p>
